        "Id": "979b272d-1e3b-440b-920b-f8954226b0b0",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "A Party to Die For",
        "Location": "LOCATION_EDGY_FOX",
        "PublicId": "129334224140",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 047bef31-022a-47c6-958b-f2a20e0a3576).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets are the four member music group &quot;Sündhafter Puls&quot;. Consisting of Julius de Koning, Egbert-Jan de Graaf, Diederik Van der Heijden and Arnaud de Lange. World renowned, they have performed all around the globe and their next stop is Club Hölle in Berlin. Unfortunately their fame didn&apos;t come from talent, but by ridding their competition by lethal manners and buying their way out of any consequenses. Head to Berlin, I&apos;m sure this party is to die for.",
